// Archetype names and writeups. Assignment logic lives in js/archetype.js;
// ids are "<domain><sign>" pairs in canonical N,E,O,A,C order (e.g. "N+O-"),
// single poles ("E+"), and "BAL" for the balanced profile.
//
// Writeup contract (docs/quiz-design.md):
//  - summary: one verb-form line for the archetype card.
//  - body:    what this combination looks like from inside and outside —
//             specific enough that the OPPOSITE profile would not claim it.
//  - costs:   what the profile pays for its strengths. Mandatory, no hedging.
//  - growth:  where profiles like this tend to get the most leverage next
//             (per-pole leverage blocks from data/prose.js are shown after it).
// Language is always "you tend to / you lean toward", never "you are an X".
// Domains: N = Negative Emotionality, E = Extraversion, O = Openness,
// A = Agreeableness, C = Conscientiousness.

