      body: "High reactivity plus high sociability means your feelings happen in public. Where an anxious introvert stews privately, you tend to process distress out loud, in company, at conversational volume — and your enthusiasms the same way. The combination makes you vivid: people always know where you stand, moods and all, and your energy can carry a room even when it is nervous energy. It also means your inner weather becomes everyone's weather. The same wiring that makes you magnetic on a good day makes your bad days a group event, and you may rely on other people to regulate feelings you never learned to settle alone.",
