      body: "Your one clearly distinctive dial is warmth: you tend to extend trust before evidence, cooperation before terms, and sympathy before judgment, while the rest of your profile sits near typical. People relax around you, confide in you, and dock in your harbor when their weather turns — you lower the temperature of every conflict you touch. The costs are harbor economics: shelter attracts heavy users along with the grateful, your accommodation gets priced into others' plans ('they won't mind'), and the harbor's own maintenance — your needs, your objections — waits behind every arriving boat.",
