      body: "Your one clearly distinctive dial is low agreeableness: skepticism, competition, and blunt speech come naturally, while the rest of your profile sits near typical. You test claims others accept, say what others soften, and remain unmoved by the social pressure that bends most people — around you, ideas and plans get sharper or get abandoned, both useful outcomes. The costs are frictional and cumulative: the same grinding that sharpens also wears — allies, goodwill, and channels of candid information all erode under constant abrasion, and people learn to route around a surface that's always rough.",
