      body: "Your one clearly distinctive dial is conscientiousness: plans get made, commitments get kept, and work gets finished to spec whether or not anyone checks, while the rest of your profile sits near typical. This is the trait that most reliably converts intention into outcome — around you, things simply happen when they were said to happen, and other people build on that certainty. The costs are the metronome's: it doesn't distinguish which passages deserve the tempo (effort flows to what's scheduled, not always to what matters), it judges rubato harshly in others, and it cannot easily stop — rest arrives only as a scheduled item, if at all.",
