      body: "Your one clearly distinctive dial is low conscientiousness: plans, systems, and steady increments hold you loosely, while the rest of your profile sits near typical. You tend to start late and adapt fast, work in bursts keyed to interest or deadline, and handle disruption better than the structured people it derails — nothing about your method depends on things going as expected, because you never expected them to. The costs are syncopation's: sustained projects punish burst-workers, other people's plans need your parts on time, and the gap between your ability and your output gets explained — by others and eventually by you — as a character verdict rather than a logistics problem.",
